From 50aa5a578dbe5164082c63927d8a7c79bdd96313 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozark <ozark@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:12:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] On-screen display for volume and Bluetooth connections

A small overlay in the lower third of the window shows the volume level
whenever it changes (knob, keys, sliders, Android Auto) and announces
Bluetooth devices connecting and disconnecting. It also maps the
standard Volume Up/Down/Mute keys to volume changes, so USB volume knobs
and steering wheel adapters work without binding actions.

Adds Material icons: bluetooth, bluetooth_connected, bluetooth_disabled,
smartphone.

Upstream-Status: Pending
